msgid ""
"Browse the Daily Brief, Daily Question, and News Transparency Dashboard "
"without an account. Sign up free to save Journey progress, create "
"discussions, or run programmes. See Getting Started in the Help Centre."
msgstr ""
"खाते के बिना Daily Brief, Daily Question और News Transparency Dashboard "
"ब्राउज़ करें। Journey प्रगति सहेजने, चर्चाएं बनाने या प्रोग्राम चलाने के लिए"
" मुफ्त साइन अप करें। सहायता केंद्र में Getting Started देखें।"

